      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=You are an expert multilingual document-summarization agent.  \nYour task is to summarize the extracted chunk of PDF text provided to you.  \n\nFollow these rules:\n\n1. Summarize the content in **approximately {{ $('On form submission').item.json[\"Number Of Word\"] }} words**.  \n2. Produce the summary **strictly in the language specified**:\n   → {{ $('On form submission').item.json.Language }}\n3. Focus only on the information that appears in the given text chunk.  \n4. Extract and emphasize:\n   - Main ideas and core arguments\n   - Key facts, data points, and findings\n   - Important limitations, disclaimers, or missing information\n5. Avoid:\n   - Repetition\n   - Guessing missing context\n   - Adding your own opinions\n   - Filler text\n\nText to summarize:\n{{ $json.text }}\n",
